    "description": "Phantom in Red by Rabanne is a Oriental Woody fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Phantom in Red was launched in 2025. Phantom in Red was created by Anne Flipo, Juliette Karagueuzoglou and Nicolas Beaulieu. Top notes are Saffron, Plum Liquor and Bergamot; middle notes are Lavender, Sage and Orange Blossom; base notes are Amberwood, Benzoin, Oud and Tobacco. Phantom in Red by Rabanne is a fragrance for men launched in 2025 and marketed by Puig. The composition is built around aromatic lavender, saffron and benzoin, combining herbal, spicy and resinous facets in a streamlined note structure. The advertising campaign features Spanish model Yeray Allgayer.Top notes: Bergamot - Plum liqueur - Saffron Heart notes: Lavender - Sage - Orange Floral Base notes: Amberwood - Tobacco - Benzoin - Oud",
